Positive Behavioral Change: By actively resting the swollen joints with targeted elevation above heart level tomorrow, you will physically utilize gravity to drain the inflammatory fluid, directly reducing capsular pressure and rewarding yourself with improved range of motion.
Home-Based Services Optional: None acutely.
